                <head>No. 148<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>Secretary Acheson visited Bonn May 23–26
                    for discussions with Foreign Secretary Eden, Foreign Minister Schuman, and Chancellor Adenauer concerning contractual relations and the European
                    Defense Community. For the records of their discussions, see <ref target="#d42"
                        >Documents 42</ref> ff.</p>
            </div>
